@model MyVoltage.Models.OperationalModels.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MirrorReadingDeleteModel
@inject MyVoltage.Services.OperationalProvider operationalProvider;
@using MyVoltage.Extensions; 
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = $"{MyVoltage.Data.SecureAreaEnum.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MirrorReadingDelete.GetDescription()} - {operationalProvider.CompanyName} - {operationalProvider.CustomerMeterSerial}";
}

<div id="loaderContent" class="loader-overlay-content">
    <div class="loader">
        <div class="text-orange text-center">
            <i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin fa-2x"></i>&nbsp;Loading...
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col">
        <div class="card p-md-4 mv-gradient">
            @if (Model != null && Model.IsSuccessful)
            {
                <div class="card-header">
                    Success!
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    Device Readings successfully deleted.<br />
                    @Model.RowsRemoved readings affected.
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer">
                    <a href="/operational/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MirrorReadingDelete" class="btn btn-outline-primary"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>&nbsp;Ok</a>
                </div>

            }
            else
            {

                <div class="card-header">

                    <div class="row mb-md-2 text-orange">
                        <div class="col text-left">
                            <h6>Search Meter:</h6>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="row mb-md-2 text-orange">
                        <div class="col">
                            <input id="serialSearch" type="text" class="form-control" />
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="row mb-md-2">
                        <div class="col text-left">
                            @*<a href="/operational/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MirrorReadingDeleteNoAccess" class="btn btn-outline-danger-sm"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i>&nbsp;No Access</a>*@
                        </div>
                        <div class="col text-right">
                            <a id="searchButton" href="#" class="btn btn-outline-primary-sm"><i class="fas fa-search"></i>&nbsp;Search</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(operationalProvider.CustomerMeterSerial))
                    {
                        @if (operationalProvider.MirrorDevices.Where(p => p.Value == operationalProvider.CustomerMeterSerial).Count() > 0)
                        {
                            <form asp-action="A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MirrorReadingDelete" enctype="multipart/form-data">
                                <div class="row text-orange mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col-12">
                                        <h5>Create Odo</h5>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col">
                                        Company:
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        @operationalProvider.CompanyName
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col">
                                        Customer Number:
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        @operationalProvider.CustomerNumber
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col">
                                        Meter No:
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        @operationalProvider.CustomerMeterNo
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col">
                                        Serial:
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        @operationalProvider.CustomerMeterSerial
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col">
                                        Pulsar Serial (Remote Addr):
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        @Model.RemoteAddress
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <label asp-for="DateLogged" class="control-label"></label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <input class="form-group" asp-for="DateLogged" placeholder="yyyy-MM-dd" />
                                        <span asp-validation-for="DateLogged" class="text-red"></span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <label asp-for="TimeLogged" class="control-label"></label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <input class="form-group" asp-for="TimeLogged" placeholder="HH:mm" />
                                        <span asp-validation-for="TimeLogged" class="text-red"></span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                @*<div class="row mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <a href="#" onclick="GetReadingAndDiff();" class="btn btn-outline-primary-sm"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>&nbsp;Check With System</a>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col">
                                        Latest Live Reading
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <label id="latestLiveReading"></label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col">
                                        Latest Live Reading Time
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <label id="latestLiveReadingTime"></label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col">
                                        Calculated Difference
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <label id="calculatedDifference"></label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="row mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col-12">
                                        <label id="differenceMessage" class="font-weight-bold"></label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>*@

                                <div class="row mb-md-2">
                                    <div class="col-12 text-right">
                                        <button class="btn btn-outline-primary-sm"><i class="fas fa-trash-alt"></i>&nbsp;Delete Readings</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </form>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <div>@operationalProvider.CustomerMeterSerial not found in mirror...</div>
                        }
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <div>Select or Search a meter to start...</div>
                    }
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer">
                </div>
            }
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

@section Scripts {
    <script>
        //function GetReadingAndDiff() {
        //    $("#loaderContent").css("display", "block");
        //    $.get("/operational/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MirrorReadingUpdate_GetReadingAndDiff?OdoReading=" + $("#OdoReading").val())
        //        .done(function (data) {
        //            $("#latestLiveReading").html(data.latestLiveReading);
        //            $("#latestLiveReadingTime").html(data.latestLiveReadingTime);
        //            $("#calculatedDifference").html(data.calculatedDifference);
        //            $("#differenceMessage").html(data.differenceMessage);
        //            $("#loaderContent").css("display", "none");
        //        });
        //}

        $("#serialSearch").autocomplete({
            source: function (request, response) {
                $.ajax({
                    url: "/operational/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MirrorReadingUpdate_Search",
                    type: "POST",
                    dataType: "json",
                    data: { serialOrName: request.term },
                    success: function (data) {
                        response($.map(data, function (item) {
                            return { label: item.text, value: item.value };
                        }))

                    }
                })
            },
            messages: {
                noResults: "", results: ""
            }
        });
        $("#searchButton").click(function () {
            $("#loaderContent").css("display", "block");
            var returnUrl = document.location.href;
            document.location.href = '/operational/changeActiveMeter/' + $("#serialSearch").val() + '?R=' + returnUrl;
        });

        $(document).ready(function () {
            GetReadingAndDiff();
        });
    </script>
}
